ss=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025, October to November was 45% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 33% and May to June at 244% on the middle of the grids. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1954, with grid 13077 at 50%.</p>"}
